          ('Price and payment',['The price of the vehicle is **{{cena}}** (in words: {{cena_vardiem}}).',{'uvodVzor':'Payment method (tick one option):','moznosti':{'skaidra':'The Buyer paid the price in cash on signing the agreement. By signing, the Seller confirms receipt of the full amount.','banka':'The Buyer will pay the price to the Seller’s bank account IBAN {{iban}} no later than {{samaksas_termins}}.'}}]),
